      "id": "claim_5fbdb11d2663445f9f1c4de5680b51bf",
      "statement": "The gatekeeper contract distinguishes observations from actions: authorizeObservation must be awaited before any data is returned to the gadget, while submitAction resolves immediately with the action possibly pending for hours — the gatekeeper applies it only when the overseer calls applyAction, is encouraged to simulate unapproved actions so gadgets keep working and queue dependents, and may request a gadget restart on rejection when simulated state cannot roll back.",
