      "id": "claim_20cacc6dd7f141af9fca2934a80e69b2",
      "statement": "Every observation, action, and hook binding is recorded as an ActionRecord in the overseer's actions collection with a workspace-sequential id, gatekeeperId, caller, denormalized resource title/url (so display survives gatekeeper deletion), state, and appliedAt; observation records never traverse the approve/reject paths, and built-in agent tool observations carry the sentinel gatekeeperId -1 so no gatekeeper lookup is ever attempted on them.",
