    {
      "id": "claim_38c1a11c6d00489aa391be903c32d97c",
      "statement": "The action log is read through listActions({beforeId, filter}) paging newest-first, with the pending filter as the query half of the query-for-state/subscribe-for-deltas contract; three indexes back it — byLastChanged (unique, resume-replay so a reconnect replays only records changed during the gap), pendingByGatekeeper (sparse, making the auto-approval drain O(pending on that gatekeeper)), and byHistoryFilter (keyed to the wire filter values so every filter is one ranged read) — all backfilled by the schema version 3 migration.",
